2F965c3989-b0a4-46bb-a5ae-bf6f8b9175e8_1000x670px_France.jpg?auto=format,compress","Zh_BaBEAACkAq6J_",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":84},"transparent","none","Shipping to Paris",[88,102],{"type":89,"text":90,"spans":91,"direction":101},"paragraph","Paris, the \"City of Light,\" is famous for the Eiffel Tower and Notre-Dame Cathedral. With over 2 million residents, it attracts millions of tourists each year. Its rich history, art museums like the Louvre, and charming cafes make Paris a unique and romantic destination in France.  ",[92,99],{"start":93,"end":94,"type":95,"data":96},274,280,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":97,"target":98},"paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Ffrance","_self",{"start":93,"end":94,"type":100},"strong","ltr",{"type":89,"text":103,"spans":104,"direction":101},"Whether you're sending gifts to family or shipping orders to customers in this capital city, we'll make sure your parcels arrive quickly and securely. Plus, if you've got packages to send to Germany or orders to ship to Italy, we deliver to over 200 countries and territories.",[105,110,111,116],{"start":106,"end":107,"type":95,"data":108},171,198,{"link_type":36,"url":109,"target":98},"paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fgermany",{"start":106,"end":107,"type":100},{"start":112,"end":113,"type":95,"data":114},202,225,{"link_type":36,"url":115,"target":98},"paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fitaly",{"start":112,"end":113,"type":100},"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":120,"version":31,"items":121,"primary":189,"id":192,"slice_type":193,"slice_label":52},"listComponent",[122,141,153,165,177],{"title":123,"content":124,"icon":134},"Regular tracking updates",[125],{"type":89,"text":126,"spans":127,"direction":101},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and email notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[128,133],{"start":129,"end":130,"type":95,"data":131},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":132,"target":98},"paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":129,"end":130,"type":100},{"dimensions":135,"alt":137,"copyright":52,"url":138,"id":139,"edit":140},{"width":136,"height":136},40,"Phone icon","paris.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":84},{"title":142,"content":143,"icon":147},"Customs made easier",[144],{"type":89,"text":145,"spans":146,"direction":101},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":148,"alt":149,"copyright":52,"url":150,"id":151,"edit":152},{"width":136,"height":136},"Passport icon","paris.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":154,"content":155,"icon":159},"Flexible printing options",[156],{"type":89,"text":157,"spans":158,"direction":101},"Print your postage labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":160,"alt":161,"copyright":52,"url":162,"id":163,"edit":164},{"width":136,"height":136},"Printer icon","paris.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":166,"content":167,"icon":171},"Bulk Send",[168],{"type":89,"text":169,"spans":170,"direction":101},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our Bulk Send tool",[],{"dimensions":172,"alt":173,"copyright":52,"url":174,"id":175,"edit":176},{"width":136,"height":136},"Laptop icon","paris.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":84},{"title":178,"content":179,"icon":183},"Trusted by top UK brands",[180],{"type":89,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":101},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":184,"alt":185,"copyright":52,"url":186,"id":187,"edit":188},{"width":136,"height":136},"Success icon","paris.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":84},{"theme":190,"title":191,"description":52},"standard","Why send internationally with Evri?","list_block$87389633-8af1-4da5-9f55-ee48a27248cd","list_block",{"variation":195,"version":31,"items":196,"primary":259,"id":269,"slice_type":270,"slice_label":52},"3Column",[197,220,239],{"Title":198,"Description":203,"Image":207,"Label":52,"UrlText":201,"Url":215,"buttonDataGtmTrack":52,"SecondaryButtonText":52,"SecondaryButtonUrl":218,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":52,"ShowAppDownloadCta":52},[199],{"type":200,"text":201,"spans":202},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[204],{"type":89,"text":205,"spans":206,"direction":101},"Book your delivery online and drop off your parcel at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops. Don’t have a printer at home? No worries! Use our free Print in ParcelShop devices to get your label. You can also book your delivery with us in person at selected Post Offices.",[],{"dimensions":208,"alt":210,"copyright":52,"url":211,"id":212,"edit":213},{"width":78,"height":209},667,"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","paris.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":214,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":84},470,{"link_type":36,"key":216,"url":217},"51df420a-707f-461a-a28c-bc712c11d2f2","paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":219},"Any",{"Title":221,"Description":225,"Image":229,"Label":52,"UrlText":223,"Url":235,"buttonDataGtmTrack":52,"SecondaryButtonText":52,"SecondaryButtonUrl":238,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":52,"ShowAppDownloadCta":52},[222],{"type":200,"text":223,"spans":224},"Lockers",[],[226],{"type":89,"text":227,"spans":228,"direction":101},"Our 24\u002F7 Lockers located across the UK make sending a parcel to Paris simple. Book your delivery online and find your nearest Locker. Scan your barcode when you arrive and place your package in an available Locker, ready for collection.",[],{"dimensions":230,"alt":231,"copyright":52,"url":232,"id":233,"edit":234},{"width":78,"height":209},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","paris.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":84},{"link_type":36,"key":236,"url":237},"2842abd9-4386-492a-84da-a9cea9b72e24","paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":219},{"Title":240,"Description":244,"Image":248,"Label":52,"UrlText":254,"Url":255,"buttonDataGtmTrack":52,"SecondaryButtonText":52,"SecondaryButtonUrl":258,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":52,"ShowAppDownloadCta":52},[241],{"type":200,"text":242,"spans":243},"Couriers",[],[245],{"type":89,"text":246,"spans":247,"direction":101},"Our Couriers can collect your parcels from your home or workplace. Just book your collection online and choose a day that works for you. We’ll give you a one-hour window for when we’ll be there to collect your parcel.",[],{"dimensions":249,"alt":250,"copyright":52,"url":251,"id":252,"edit":253},{"width":78,"height":209},"An older woman hands a parcel to a courier for collection. The courier is signing a blue slip. Blue Evri van visible in the background.","paris.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oqXJbqstJ9-cLp_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10213.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6oqXJbqstJ9-cLp",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":84},"Courier collection",{"link_type":36,"key":256,"url":257},"df6ec706-5367-4052-8efb-5cb766dd7f05","paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":219},{"SectionTitle":260,"SectionDescription":265,"theme":52},[261],{"type":262,"text":263,"spans":264,"direction":101},"heading2","How to send a parcel to Paris with Evri",[],[266],{"type":89,"text":267,"spans":268,"direction":101},"For shipping to Paris, choose from three easy ways. Simply drop off your packages at one of our 10,000+ ParcelShops or Lockers or arrange a Courier collection from your doorstep.",[],"article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":272,"version":31,"items":273,"primary":275,"id":282,"slice_type":118,"slice_label":52},"cardNoImageWithCta",[274],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":276,"CardText":277,"ButtonText":52,"ButtonUrl":281,"IsEco":20},"How long does it take to send a parcel to Paris?",[278],{"type":89,"text":279,"spans":280,"direction":101},"It takes between 6 to 9 days to send a parcel to France.",[],{"link_type":219},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":284,"version":31,"items":285,"primary":287,"id":313,"slice_type":118,"slice_label":52},"default-slice",[286],{},{"CardImage":288,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":295,"CardText":296,"ButtonText":310,"ButtonUrl":311,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":289,"alt":290,"copyright":52,"url":291,"id":292,"edit":293},{"width":78,"height":209},"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and using a blue hand-held device to scan multiple parcels placed on the countertop in front of them. The customer can be seen in the foreground.","paris.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc",{"x":294,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":84},47,"Send multiple parcels to Paris",[297,300,304,307],{"type":89,"text":298,"spans":299,"direction":101},"Need to send multiple parcels? If you're dealing with several shipments or managing an international business, our bulk send tool makes it easy to handle your deliveries to Paris and beyond.",[],{"type":301,"text":302,"spans":303,"direction":101},"o-list-item","Log in or create an Evri account and head to bulk send. Click the ‘Link Account’ button to connect your marketplace account. Choose from eBay, Etsy, Amazon, Shopify and more, or upload your parcels using a CSV file",[],{"type":301,"text":305,"spans":306,"direction":101},"Package and book your items and print off your postage label at home or in-store with our Print in ParcelShop device",[],{"type":301,"text":308,"spans":309,"direction":101},"Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers or book a courier collection",[],"View integrations",{"link_type":36,"key":312,"url":38},"44ba0a4d-d826-46a3-b5c4-a057e55b64c9","card$fa303a60-84d8-4787-b754-15518974d525",{"variation":272,"version":31,"items":315,"primary":317,"id":327,"slice_type":118,"slice_label":52},[316],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":318,"CardText":319,"ButtonText":323,"ButtonUrl":324,"IsEco":20},"Send parcels to France",[320],{"type":89,"text":321,"spans":322,"direction":101},"We've put together a simple guide for shipping to France. It includes information on prohibited items, national holidays that might affect delivery times, and how to correctly format addresses for your labels.",[],"Learn more",{"link_type":36,"key":325,"url":97,"target":326},"6eb1d1ab-d029-46f2-b6b2-e4f3ff4fa17e","","card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":284,"version":31,"items":329,"primary":423,"id":425,"slice_type":426,"slice_label":52},[330,361,379,411],{"questionTitle":331,"questionBody":332},"What can I send to France?",[333,336,358],{"type":89,"text":334,"spans":335,"direction":101},"Whether you’re sending parcels to Paris or another destination in France, there are some restrictions to be aware of.",[],{"type":89,"text":337,"spans":338,"direction":101},"You can find out which items are not permitted by taking a look at our prohibited items list as well as the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority pages.",[339,345,346,351,352,357],{"start":340,"end":341,"type":95,"data":342},71,92,{"link_type":36,"url":343,"target":344},"\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send","_blank",{"start":340,"end":341,"type":100},{"start":347,"end":348,"type":95,"data":349},108,140,{"link_type":36,"url":350,"target":344},"paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":347,"end":348,"type":100},{"start":353,"end":354,"type":95,"data":355},149,176,{"link_type":36,"url":356,"target":344},"paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":353,"end":354,"type":100},{"type":89,"text":359,"spans":360,"direction":101},"These provide the latest guidelines on items that can’t be sent via airlines.",[],{"questionTitle":362,"questionBody":363},"Will I need to deal with customs when sending to Paris?",[364,367,370],{"type":89,"text":365,"spans":366,"direction":101},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":89,"text":368,"spans":369,"direction":101},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":89,"text":371,"spans":372,"direction":101},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[373,378],{"start":374,"end":375,"type":95,"data":376},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":377,"target":344},"paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":374,"end":375,"type":100},{"questionTitle":380,"questionBody":381},"Is there import tax from the UK to Paris?",[382,385,394,397,400,403,406],{"type":200,"text":383,"spans":384,"direction":101},"UK business or marketplace seller? ",[],{"type":89,"text":386,"spans":387,"direction":101},"If you’re an online seller sending goods up to the value of €150 and to a destination within the EU, you might want to use Import One Stop Shop (IOSS). IOSS deals with VAT charges at the point of sale. So, as well as making life simpler for you, it also benefits your recipient - there’ll be no surprise costs for your customer when they receive their goods. Check out our guide on sending parcels to Europe to find out more about IOSS.​",[388,393],{"start":389,"end":390,"type":95,"data":391},382,407,{"link_type":36,"url":392,"target":344},"paris.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Feurope",{"start":389,"end":390,"type":100},{"type":89,"text":395,"spans":396,"direction":101},"If you haven’t sold through a marketplace or if your parcel destination is outside the EU, remember to let your recipient know they may need to pay customs charges.",[],{"type":200,"text":398,"spans":399,"direction":101},"International standard delivery service",[],{"type":89,"text":401,"spans":402,"direction":101},"If you're using our international standard delivery service, your recipient may need to pay taxes and duties either before your items leave the UK or when the parcel reaches its destination. ",[],{"type":89,"text":404,"spans":405,"direction":101},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":89,"text":371,"spans":407,"direction":101},[408,410],{"start":374,"end":375,"type":95,"data":409},{"link_type":36,"url":377,"target":344},{"start":374,"end":375,"type":100},{"questionTitle":412,"questionBody":413},"Can I track my international parcels?",[414],{"type":89,"text":415,"spans":416,"direction":101},"Yes, you can track all your Evri parcels headed to France for free. Enter your 16-digit tracking number on our tracking page to see the status of your parcel's journey. Your recipient will also receive email notifications to keep updated on their parcel's progress.",[417,421],{"start":418,"end":419,"type":95,"data":420},111,124,{"link_type":36,"url":132,"target":98},{"start":418,"end":422,"type":100},125,{"title":424},"FAQs about shipping to Paris","frequently_asked_questions$57fefc8c-b2c9-4081-82a7-95a11a3df31f","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,119,194,271,283,314,328],["Reactive",429],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":430,"$sclients":497,"$sglobal-basket-count":52,"$sglobal-user-postcode":326},{"abtasty":431,"accessibe":435,"appPromoBanner":438,"autoDivertUpdates":441,"awin":444,"bulkInternational":447,"bulkSendEnabled":450,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":453,"enableBasketCount":456,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":459,"euCustomsDuty":462,"groovyAdvert":465,"newInternationalSendFlow":468,"newinternationalpages":475,"oohPreferenceFlag":479,"opentel":482,"premium":485,"savedCards":488,"smallParcelSize":491,"yourPricesDrawer":494},{"_createdAt":432,"_updatedAt":433,"enabled":434},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":436,"_updatedAt":437,"enabled":434},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":439,"_updatedAt":440,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":442,"_updatedAt":443,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdA